-- Local sample data for the showcase: the bundled Chronos examples (examples/pools, examples/quests/<pool>) as
-- canonical JSON trees, plus hunters_vow (docs/quests.md), hydras_bane (Tyche, Chrysos, Vulcan, ExperienceTailor types
-- and a fail block, in an extra boss_hunts pool), smiths_favour (no difficulty, a custom objective), and for
-- ExperienceTailor characters old_roads (scope: account in a character pool) and the account pool legacy.
--
--   npx wrangler d1 migrations apply chronos --local
--   npx wrangler d1 execute chronos --local --file=scripts/seed-local.sql
--
-- Running it again replaces the same rows. into_the_mines has hidden_until_unlocked, so the site hides it unless
-- SHOW_HIDDEN is "true".

